# The repo stores LF and prettier is configured for LF, but core.autocrlf=true was rewriting the
# working tree to CRLF on every checkout — which made `npm run lint` report thousands of
# "Delete ␍" warnings and drowned the real ones. Forcing LF in the working tree too keeps the
# three in agreement on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.world binary
*.dunya binary
*.db binary
